title: A folder received from someone sharing is not given to the guest's extensions: the guest is asked, restricted mode shows while it is not trusted, and once trusted for the session extensions run on it
folders: share-text
limit: 75
guest-extensions: trust-extension
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
guest-expect-log: asking whether to trust .*share-text
guest-expect-log: kept in restricted mode
guest-expect-log: the status bar shows restricted mode
guest-expect-log: share-text is trusted
guest-expect-log: extension qa\.fake-trust started
guest-expect-log: the status bar no longer shows restricted mode

wait 3000
share start
wait 22000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
mark asked
wait 600
answer Stay in restricted mode
wait 1500
mark restricted
wait 600
trust
wait 800
answer Trust the folder
wait 3500
mark trusted
wait 600
quit
wait 1500
